===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[vena]] [[cava]]|vena cavae}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} Either of the two large [[vein]]s that take oxygen depleted blood, from the upper body and from the lower body, and return it to the right [[atrium]] of the [[heart]].

